  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Glad&apos;s House Football Extravaganza 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Following the success of Glad&apos;s House Kenya &quot;Football Extravaganza&quot; back in 2007, it is our aspiration to run another event in Aug 23 to help reignite, not only the GHK football programme in Mombasa but all our sports programmes, which have suffered greatly following the challenges and restrictions of the past few years. We aim to use this event as a catalyst to create a sustainable sports programme for the local community and more importantly the &quot;Street Children and Young People of Mombasa&quot;.</narrative>
  </description>
